*-------------- Dialogstruktur KOMKBME wird gefüllt -------------------*
FORM KOPFDIALOGSTRUKTUR_FUELLEN USING XSIMU LIKE AM07M-XTEST.

  IF NOT XSIMU IS INITIAL.
    NMKPF = MKPF.
  ELSE.
    NMKPF = XMKPF.
  ENDIF.

  CALL FUNCTION 'COMMUNICATION_AREA_KOMKBME'
       EXPORTING
            MSG_MKPF     = NMKPF
            MSG_T158     = T158
            MSG_PR_UNAME = PRINT_UNAME
       TABLES
            TAB_PART = PART.

ENDFORM.